config BR2_PACKAGE_CADDY
	bool "caddy"
	default y
	help
	  Stock Caddy web server (ADR-0004 §7) — the node-local reverse proxy
	  the rasputin-agent runs to front apps: TLS-terminate each app's
	  Mesh-CA leaf and Host-route to its loopback port. Driven entirely via
	  the admin API by the agent; auto-HTTPS is off (Rasputin mints and
	  ships the leaves, never Caddy's ACME).

	  A pre-built pure-Go static release binary (CGO-free, so it runs on the
	  musl userland with no extra deps). See package/caddy/caddy.mk.

	  https://caddyserver.com
